[
  {
    "title": "Packets, Routing & Protocols",
    "tag": "LESSON 24",
    "code": "Chapter 5 · Computer systems and networks",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Packets<br>&amp; Routing</h1><p class=\"zh\">分包 · 重组 · 传输协议</p><p class=\"small\">90 minutes · Follow a message through a changing network</p>",
    "note": "从上一课可达路径进入消息怎样分段传递。区分网络层转发、接收端重组与传输可靠性，不把所有责任归给一个路由器。",
    "kind": "dark",
    "time": "0–2 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve paths and protocols",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL",
    "code": "CSN-1.A/B",
    "html": "<p>What makes a path valid? Why do connected devices still need a protocol?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Every consecutive pair needs a link. Protocols specify agreed communication formats and behavior.</div></details>",
    "note": "让学生用上一课六节点图解释，不仅背定义。为动态路由打基础：一个有效路径并不保证一直使用它，也不保证数据无损送到。",
    "time": "2–6 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Questions a packet model can answer",
    "tag": "TARGETS",
    "code": "CSN-1.C",
    "html": "<ul><li>What data belong in each packet?</li><li>How does a receiver restore order?</li><li>What happens when a piece never arrives?</li></ul><p class=\"small\">Evidence: predicted buffers, observations and a protocol comparison.</p>",
    "note": "告知活动的发送内容固定，实验结果可复核。目标是说明机制和局限，不配置真实TCP连接或抓取学生网络流量。",
    "time": "6–8 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A packet contains data and metadata",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "CSN-1.C.1/2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A packet carries a data chunk and metadata needed for delivery and reconstruction.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A packet carries a data chunk and metadata needed for delivery and reconstruction.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Payload</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">part of the message</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Metadata</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">destination +</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">reassembly information</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Packet</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">data with context</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Different protocol layers supply different metadata.</p>",
    "note": "CSN-1.C.1–2概括packet。不要说每一个IP头都含课堂的1/4编号，顺序信息属于相应传输/应用机制；本图是抽象结构，不是比特级格式。",
    "time": "8–12 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Our message becomes four chunks",
    "tag": "WORKED MODEL",
    "code": "CSN-1.C.1/2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Packet IDs and three-character chunks. The visible symbol denotes a space.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Packet IDs and three-character chunks. The visible symbol denotes a space.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 225\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"35\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"165\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 1</text><text x=\"165\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">HEL</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 2</text><text x=\"455\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">LO␠</text><rect x=\"615\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"745\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 3</text><text x=\"745\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">AP␠</text><rect x=\"905\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1035\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 4</text><text x=\"1035\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">CSP</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">␠ represents one space</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Message: <span class=\"mono\">HELLO AP CSP</span>. The model uses 3 characters per packet.</p>",
    "note": "精确12字符，两处空格必须保留。教学可见空格符不是实际数据额外字符，ID1为HEL，2为LO加空格，3为AP加空格，4为CSP。真实分包大小并不固定三个字符。",
    "time": "12–16 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Arrival order may differ from message order",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "CSN-1.C.3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Packet IDs and three-character chunks. The visible symbol denotes a space.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Packet IDs and three-character chunks. The visible symbol denotes a space.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 225\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"35\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"165\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 4</text><text x=\"165\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">CSP</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 2</text><text x=\"455\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">LO␠</text><rect x=\"615\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"745\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 1</text><text x=\"745\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">HEL</text><rect x=\"905\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1035\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 3</text><text x=\"1035\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">AP␠</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">␠ represents one space</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Arrival order: 4, 2, 1, 3. Reassembly uses the IDs, not arrival position.</p>",
    "note": "乱序来自可能不同路径与等待，本模型不模拟真实延迟。四张卡的空间顺序仅表示到达顺序，不代表原句顺序；重组按ID位置。正式TCP使用字节序号而不是本例四个教学ID。",
    "time": "16–20 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "The receiver can buffer pieces before completing",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "CSN-1.C.2/3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The receiver buffers pieces by identity and completes only when all required chunks are present.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The receiver buffers pieces by identity and completes only when all required chunks are present.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Receive ID 4</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">store in slot 4</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Receive 2 and 1</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">fill their slots</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Receive ID 3</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">all required slots full</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Knowing the destination is different from knowing the reconstruction order.</p>",
    "note": "把接收buffer看作带位置的记录，不必编写list代码。IP目的地址告诉往哪送；顺序/完整性信息帮助恢复数据。不要把先到4错误显示为句首。",
    "time": "20–24 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "IP provides best-effort packet delivery",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "CSN-1.C.3/4 · IP",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Packets may arrive in order, out of order, or not at all.</p><p class=\"visual-note\">A possible path does not guarantee that every packet arrives.</p>",
    "note": "CED明示三种到达情况；RFC791 IP自身不提供端到端可靠性、排序和重传保证。图中连接存在也不能排除拥塞、故障等；只列已学可理解原因。",
    "time": "24–28 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Routes can change while addresses stay the same",
    "tag": "ROUTING",
    "code": "CSN-1.B.5 · CSN-1.C",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The same source and destination can communicate over a different route after a link becomes unavailable.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The same source and destination can communicate over a different route after a link becomes unavailable.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Earlier route</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">S–A–C–T</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A–C unavailable</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">choose another path</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Later route</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">S–A–D–T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Internet routing is usually dynamic, not a single preassigned path.</p>",
    "note": "给定两个路径都符合合同。图是变化示意，不声称现实每包都必须走不同路；连续数据可能同路也可能异路。网络状态与路由规则决定转发。",
    "time": "28–32 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "TCP adds reliability for an ordered byte stream",
    "tag": "PROTOCOL",
    "code": "CSN-1.C.4 · RFC 9293",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"TCP endpoints coordinate acknowledgments and retransmission to provide a reliable ordered byte-stream service.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"TCP endpoints coordinate acknowledgments and retransmission to provide a reliable ordered byte-stream service.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Sending endpoint</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">tracks unconfirmed data</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Receiving endpoint</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">orders data +</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">acknowledges receipt</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Recovery</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">retransmit when needed</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Persistent failure can still prevent a connection from completing.</p>",
    "note": "TCP通过端点机制提供可靠有序字节流，不能教“每个包一定到达”。重传可能送来新的副本；永久断连仍可能失败。课堂手动补包仅演示恢复思路，不声称实现完整TCP。",
    "time": "32–36 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "UDP leaves more responsibility to the application",
    "tag": "COMPARE",
    "code": "CSN-1.C.4 · RFC 768",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"UDP does not itself guarantee delivery or ordering; applications decide how to handle those needs.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"UDP does not itself guarantee delivery or ordering; applications decide how to handle those needs.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">UDP datagram</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">send a message</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">UDP itself</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">no delivery/order</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">or retransmission guarantee</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Application choice</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">handle loss or</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">accept missing updates</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Lower built-in recovery work does not mean “always faster” or “always better.”</p>",
    "note": "RFC768说明不保证交付与重复保护。应用可自行实现确认重传，因此不能说用UDP应用永远不可靠。某些实时更新可接受漏一次而不等待过时数据，但任务需求决定取舍。",
    "time": "36–40 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Investigation: predict packet contents",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.C",
    "html": "<p class=\"small\"><a href=\"Chapter_5_Network_Lab.html#packets\" target=\"_blank\">Open Packets</a>. Use HELLO AP CSP and 3 characters per packet.</p><p>Before starting, write IDs 1–4 with their exact payloads, including spaces.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1: “HEL”; 2: “LO ”; 3: “AP ”; 4: “CSP”.</div></details>",
    "note": "40–44分钟活动1。不要把空格删除或把3个字符当3个字节的通用格式。此固定ASCII例恰好方便，但实验规则单位为字符。",
    "time": "40–44 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Predict the buffer after two arrivals",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.C.2/3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Packet IDs and three-character chunks. The visible symbol denotes a space.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Packet IDs and three-character chunks. The visible symbol denotes a space.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 225\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"35\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"165\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 4</text><text x=\"165\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">CSP</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 2</text><text x=\"455\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">LO␠</text><rect x=\"615\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"745\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 1</text><text x=\"745\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">HEL</text><rect x=\"905\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1035\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 3</text><text x=\"1035\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">AP␠</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">␠ represents one space</text></svg></figure><p>After only packets 4 and 2 arrive, which IDs are still missing?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">IDs 1 and 3. The receiver has useful pieces but cannot yet reconstruct the complete message.</div></details>",
    "note": "44–48分钟活动2。先纸上画四槽，填ID4和2；不要移动到槽1、2。模拟器如一次展示全部，可逐步或用纸面停在两包后，记录预测。",
    "time": "44–48 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Run the out-of-order delivery",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.C",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"An out-of-order arrival sequence is checked against predicted receiver buffers.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An out-of-order arrival sequence is checked against predicted receiver buffers.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Predict</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">buffer after each arrival</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Deliver</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">4, 2, 1, 3</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Compare</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">ordered final payload</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Record the final message and explain why it differs from arrival-order concatenation.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">The complete message is HELLO AP CSP, because chunks are assembled in ID order 1, 2, 3, 4.</div></details>",
    "note": "48–52分钟活动3。要求不仅写原句，还说明恢复顺序依据。arrivalorder直接连接会以CSP开始，是可观察反例。",
    "time": "48–52 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Drop one packet and inspect the evidence",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 6 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.C.3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Packet IDs and three-character chunks. The visible symbol denotes a space.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Packet IDs and three-character chunks. The visible symbol denotes a space.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 225\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"35\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"165\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 1</text><text x=\"165\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">HEL</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 2</text><text x=\"455\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">LO␠</text><rect x=\"615\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"745\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 3</text><text x=\"745\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">missing</text><rect x=\"905\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1035\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 4</text><text x=\"1035\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">CSP</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">␠ represents one space</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Run with packet 3 missing. What is present, what is missing, and is completion justified?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">IDs 1, 2 and 4 are present; ID 3 is missing. The receiver must report an incomplete buffer.</div></details>",
    "note": "52–58分钟活动4，给6分钟检查并写证据。可见缺口不是成功消息。不要猜出AP空格后把猜测当交付，因为本模型完整性依据收到所有必需包。即使知道原文也不能冒称网络传输完成。",
    "time": "52–58 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retry the missing piece",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 6 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.C · recovery model",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A retry can fill a missing packet slot, after which the receiver checks completeness again.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A retry can fill a missing packet slot, after which the receiver checks completeness again.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Incomplete</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">ID 3 absent</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Retry</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">send missing ID 3</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Check again</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">all four IDs present?</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Record the before/after buffers. A retry attempt alone is not evidence of receipt.</p>",
    "note": "58–64分钟活动5。本实验retry成功交付后可完成，但学生需要以ID3已在buffer为证据。它只是手动恢复模型，不含TCP超时估计、拥塞控制或完整确认状态机。",
    "time": "58–64 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Investigate a route change",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.B.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\"/><path d=\"M521.0 51.0L539.0 69.0M521.0 69.0L539.0 51.0\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">In <a href=\"Chapter_5_Network_Lab.html#resilience\" target=\"_blank\">Resilience</a>, disable A–C. Predict and verify the selected S-to-T path.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">S–A–D–T, still 3 hops under the lab’s tie rule.</div></details>",
    "note": "64–68分钟活动6。切换Resilience不是假定包模拟器真实追踪每包路径。先reset全边再只关闭A-C；记录路由变化与仍可达。",
    "time": "64–68 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Keep a delivery investigation record",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.C",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A delivery report bases completeness on the receiver state rather than sender intention.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A delivery report bases completeness on the receiver state rather than sender intention.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Arrival order</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">what arrived when</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Buffer state</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">which IDs are present</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Conclusion</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">complete or incomplete</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">and why</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Add one sentence explaining what the manual retry model leaves out.</p>",
    "note": "68–72分钟活动7。收集正常乱序、缺ID3、补ID3三个状态和A-C失败路由。最后说明真实网络更复杂，不能把按钮演示称完整TCP。",
    "time": "68–72 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Protocol choices depend on the task",
    "tag": "TRANSFER",
    "code": "CSN-1.C.4",
    "html": "<p>Task A needs an exact ordered file. Task B displays frequent live position updates and may skip an old update.</p><p>Explain why their recovery priorities may differ.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">A needs missing data recovered and order restored. B may prefer a newer update to waiting for stale data. A real application still must choose and implement suitable handling.</div></details>",
    "note": "任务B不是所有游戏/视频必用UDP的断言，现代应用协议多样。只评价需求，不让学生死背“视频UDP文件TCP”万能映射。",
    "time": "72–76 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Original check: select TWO",
    "tag": "CHECK",
    "code": "CSN-1.C",
    "html": "<ul><li>A. Packets can arrive out of order.</li><li>B. An IP route guarantees every packet will arrive.</li><li>C. UDP itself guarantees ordered retransmission.</li><li>D. TCP uses endpoint mechanisms to support reliable ordered delivery.</li></ul><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">A and D. B overclaims IP service; C assigns TCP-like guarantees to UDP itself.</div></details>",
    "note": "强调选D不等于保证网络永不失败。可要求学生在句后补条件“永久断连仍会失败”。",
    "time": "76–80 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Separate delivery from recovery",
    "tag": "SYNTHESIS",
    "code": "CSN-1.C.4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"IP, TCP and UDP have distinct communication roles.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"IP, TCP and UDP have distinct communication roles.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">IP</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">address + forward</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">TCP</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">reliability + ordering</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">UDP</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">datagrams without</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">those built-in guarantees</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Protocols work together; they are not three competing types of physical cable.</p>",
    "note": "此为角色总结，TCP/UDP常在IP之上，不是IP被TCP取代。图并列是职责比较，不表达同层协议全等。OSI七层细分不在本课要求。",
    "time": "80–84 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Homework and evidence to keep",
    "tag": "HOMEWORK",
    "code": "Chapter 5",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">12 original questions · 30 teacher marks</p><ul><li>Preserve exact spaces in packet payloads.</li><li>Use receiver evidence when claiming completeness.</li><li>Explain a protocol tradeoff without absolute guarantees.</li></ul>",
    "note": "保留模型与真实机制区分的句子，作为L25容错与端到端限制基础。",
    "time": "84–87 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit ticket",
    "tag": "EXIT",
    "code": "CSN-1.C",
    "html": "<p>1. Why can arrival order differ from final order?<br>2. What is missing if ID 3 is absent?<br>3. Does TCP eliminate every possible communication failure?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. Metadata let the receiver restore order.<br>2. The “AP ” chunk.<br>3. No; persistent failures can still prevent completion.</div></details>",
    "note": "各1分。第二题保留末尾空格；第一题若只说互联网很快，没有解释顺序机制不给满分。",
    "time": "87–90 min"
  }
]
